 "summary": "Gateway profile for the Carlo Gavazzi EM24: 105 objects (96 AI, 6 AO, 3 BI), 51 polled by default. Inputs give voltages, currents, W, VA and VAR per phase and total, demand and peak demand, PF, frequency, total, partial, per-phase and tariff kWh/kvarh and exported energy; unpolled outputs reset the counters and peak demand.",
